stream
BT
/F1 24 Tf 56 760 Td (Messthon Grid Rules) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 56 736 Td (A compact guide to spacing, typography and layout rhythm.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 688 Td (1. Base grid) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 668 Td (Use an 8 px spacing base. Components may use 4 px for tight inline rhythm.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 652 Td (The navigation rail is 244 px on desktop and 72 px on tablet.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 636 Td (The conversation list defaults to 328 px. Information panel defaults to 304 px.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 588 Td (2. Typography) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 568 Td (Inter Variable is the only interface family. Body sizes range from 11 to 15 px.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 552 Td (Headings use 620 to 660 weight and negative tracking. Avoid all-caps labels longer than 2 words.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 504 Td (3. Surfaces) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 484 Td (Use neutral green-tinted surfaces. Dividers are 1 px and never purely decorative.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 468 Td (Green is reserved for primary actions, focus, active navigation and selected states.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
