7 0 obj
<< /Length 1078 >>
stream
BT
/F1 22 Tf 56 760 Td (Conversation list) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 732 Td (Each row must expose: avatar, display name, last message, time, unread count.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 716 Td (Protocol and account identity are displayed as one compact metadata line.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 700 Td (Pinned and muted states use 11 px icons and a text hint when space allows.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 652 Td (Row anatomy) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 632 Td (Avatar: 44 px. Body: flexible. Trailing badge: 20 px minimum height.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 616 Td (Vertical padding is 10 px. Repeated rows have a 1 px active indicator on the left.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 568 Td (Search and filtering) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 548 Td (The local search field filters conversations only. Global search lives in the sidebar.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 532 Td (Protocol chips replace the active account filter. Account filtering uses a popover.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 484 Td (Empty state) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 464 Td (Keep empty states compact: icon, one sentence and a recovery action.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 448 Td (Never fill empty space with decorative charts or fake statistics.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
