9 0 obj
<< /Length 1162 >>
stream
BT
/F1 22 Tf 56 760 Td (Chat and composer) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 732 Td (Incoming bubbles use the lowest surface with a 1 px outline.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 716 Td (Outgoing bubbles use the primary container. Both use 13 px outer radius.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 700 Td (The bottom corner nearest the author is reduced to 5 px for grouping.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 652 Td (Message metadata) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 632 Td (Time is always visible. Delivery state is shown only when the protocol supports it.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 616 Td (XMPP in this prototype exposes delivery state without read receipts.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 600 Td (Matrix exposes read receipts and mirrors them in the interface.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 552 Td (Composer) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 532 Td (The composer keeps the active account visible beneath the input field.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 516 Td (Enter sends. Shift+Enter adds a new line. Both are configurable in Settings.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 500 Td (Attachments, images and emoji are first-class actions and must remain keyboard reachable.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 452 Td (Unread state) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 432 Td (Unread messages are separated by a labelled divider. Reading is explicit in the prototype.) Tj
ET
endstream
