/F1 22 Tf 56 760 Td (Responsive behavior) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 732 Td (Desktop: navigation, conversation list, chat and information panel.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 716 Td (Panel widths are adjustable by pointer or keyboard separators.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 700 Td (Tablet: compact 72 px navigation rail and information panel as an overlay.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 684 Td (Mobile: bottom navigation, full-screen conversation, large touch targets.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 636 Td (Accessibility) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 616 Td (All interactive elements have accessible names. Focus is always visible.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 600 Td (Icon buttons use a consistent 1.8 px stroke weight from Lucide.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 584 Td (Text contrast targets WCAG AA for body copy and controls.) Tj
/F1 14 Tf 56 536 Td (Identity rules) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 516 Td (Never merge accounts in metadata. Every conversation exposes its source account.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 56 500 Td (Matrix and XMPP security features are displayed separately and never generalized.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 56 448 Td (This document is a demonstration asset for the Messthon UI prototype.) Tj
ET
